hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17644","Muhammad ibn Ja'far narrated to us: Shu'bah narrated to us, from Jabir, who said: I heard al-Sha'bi say: I testify against Abu Sa'id ibn Zayd that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) passed by a funeral and stood up."
"19249","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us from Jabir, he said: I heard al-Shabi, he said: I bear witness upon Abu Said ibn Zayd that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) passed by a funeral and stood."
